At present the Internet is very popular and widely used. People can find enormous information from the Internet. Undoubtedly the Internet is the largest source of information and digital contents in the world. However, }{\fcs1 \af22\afs30 \fcs0 
\f22\fs30\insrsid12018349\charrsid3809479 \hich\af22\dbch\af14\loch\f22 the}{\fcs1 \af22\afs30 \fcs0 \f22\fs30\insrsid13722057\charrsid3809479 \hich\af22\dbch\af14\loch\f22  information is scattered and stor\hich\af22\dbch\af14\loch\f22 
ed in different places on the Internet}{\fcs1 \af22\afs30 \fcs0 \f22\fs30\insrsid12018349 \hich\af22\dbch\af14\loch\f22 , this brings some difficulty for the user to find his/her intended information easily}{\fcs1 \af22\afs30 \fcs0 
\f22\fs30\insrsid13722057\charrsid3809479 \hich\af22\dbch\af14\loch\f22 . It would be better if there is one place where useful information are organized and stored together.}{\fcs1 \af22\afs30 \fcs0 \f22\fs30\insrsid2435661\charrsid3809479 
\par }{\fcs1 \af22\afs30 \fcs0 \f22\fs30\insrsid13722057\charrsid3809479 \tab \hich\af22\dbch\af14\loch\f22 The attempt in this thesis i\hich\af22\dbch\af14\loch\f22 s to develop a web site which gather}{\fcs1 \af22\afs30 \fcs0 \f22\fs30\insrsid3475213 
\hich\af22\dbch\af14\loch\f22 s}{\fcs1 \af22\afs30 \fcs0 \f22\fs30\insrsid13722057\charrsid3809479 \hich\af22\dbch\af14\loch\f22  all forms of digital information and }{\fcs1 \af22\afs30 \fcs0 \f22\fs30\insrsid4415218\charrsid3809479 
\hich\af22\dbch\af14\loch\f22 contents,}{\fcs1 \af22\afs30 \fcs0 \f22\fs30\insrsid13722057\charrsid3809479 \hich\af22\dbch\af14\loch\f22  e.g. images, sound, }{\fcs1 \af22\afs30 \fcs0 \f22\fs30\insrsid4415218\charrsid3809479 \hich\af22\dbch\af14\loch\f22 
videos, etc. in one place. The user can access to the site}{\fcs1 \af22\afs30 \fcs0 \f22\fs30\insrsid12018349 \hich\af22\dbch\af14\loch\f22  in order}{\fcs1 \af22\afs30 \fcs0 \f22\fs30\insrsid4415218\charrsid3809479 \hich\af22\dbch\af14\loch\f22 
 to store, copy, and search this information by themselves using a web browser.}{\fcs1 \af22\afs30 \fcs0 \f22\fs30\insrsid13722057\charrsid3809479 
\par }{\fcs1 \af22\afs30 \fcs0 \f22\fs30\insrsid4415218\charrsid3809479 \tab \hich\af22\dbch\af14\loch\f22 The\hich\af22\dbch\af14\loch\f22  web site is developed as a web application using Java Servlet. The application allows the use}{\fcs1 \af22\afs30 \fcs0 
